<Item XName="UF-OFDM Source Measurement" UserName="UF-OFDM Source Measurement" Type="Notes">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt; &lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1pt; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in; mso-element: para-border-div; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .75pt&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .75pt; mso-padding-alt: 0in 0in 1.0pt 0in&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;UF-OFDM&amp;nbsp;Source Characteristics &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = &quot;o&quot; ns = &quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office&quot; /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;Keysight&amp;nbsp;Technologies SystemVue Example Workspace&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;,&apos;serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;,&apos;serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;This&amp;nbsp;example workspace&amp;nbsp;demonstrates&amp;nbsp;spectrum performance for a universal-filtered &lt;SPAN style=&quot;WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(34,34,34); TEXT-ALIGN: left; FONT: 16px/19px arial, sans-serif; WIDOWS: 1; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;Orthogonal frequency-division multiplexing&lt;/FONT&gt; &lt;/SPAN&gt;(UF-OFDM) system. Active subcarriers are composed of some subbands which are consisted of pilots and data. Number of subcarriers in every subband is the same. The time domain signal of every subband passed through a filter and the transmitter signal is the superposition of that. It provides the flexibility to choose a pulse shape by changing the filter that is controlled by filter coefficient and filter length. In this example the filter coefficient in Equation is gotten by chebyshev window with length 16 and Fourier transform sidelobe &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;A name=OLE_LINK1&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;magnitude&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt; 40 dB or 120 dB.&amp;nbsp;The different location of every subband is implemented by multiplying the time domain data with certain frequency offset. When the FilterCoef and the FilterLength is set to 1, UF-OFDM system will turn to OFDM system. Please make sure the frequence filter coefficients on active subcarrier is not equal to zero, otherwise the result of UF-OFDM_EVM would be meaningless.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;,&apos;serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;Simulation Instruction&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;,&apos;serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;,&apos;serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT: 7pt &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 8pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Arial&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpFirst style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;1.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; The &apos;NumSubcarriers&apos; is the total subcarriers and the DFT size.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Set the &apos;NumSubbands&apos; parameter to define the number of subbands in the total subcarriers and &#x2018;NumSubcarriersPerSubband&#x2019; is the number of subcarriers in every subband.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;3.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Set the &apos;StarLocationSubband&apos; parameter&amp;nbsp;to define the index of the first subcarrier in every subband and the size of this parameter should be equal to the number of subband. The element of this parameter should be in the range of [-NumSubcarriers/2, NumSubcarriers/2-1].&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;4.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;A name=OLE_LINK5&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;A name=OLE_LINK4&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5&quot;&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&apos;BaseFilterLength&apos; parameter&amp;nbsp;defined the length of filter without ovsampling, and its new value FilterLength&amp;nbsp;should be equal to the size of &#x2018;FilterCoef&#x2019; which is given in the Equation.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK4&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;5.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; The parament &apos;PilotsLocation&apos; is the relative location according to the index of first subcarrier in every subband. The range of it is in [0, NumSubcarriersPerSubband-1]. And &#x2018;PilotsSeq&#x2019; is the sequence value of pilots. The size of &#x2018;PilotsSeq&#x2019; could be bigger than the size of &apos;PilotsLocation&apos; so that every UFMC symbol can be allocated with different pilot values to avoid the spur in the specturm. Those parameter could be disabled&amp;nbsp;when parameter &apos;PilotsEnable&apos; is set to NO.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;6.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Considering the unflatness of the filter in the subband, parameter &#x2018;CompensateFilterResponse&#x2019; will multiply the data and pilots in subband with filter compensated coefficients. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;7.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; If UF-OFDM_Receiver is used, please set PilotsEnable to &apos;YES&apos;. In this example, if PilotsEnable is set to &apos;NO&apos;, UFMC_EVM model would be turned to disabled automatically.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;8.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;The parament&amp;nbsp;&apos;NumSubcarriersPerSubband&apos; should be a positive even integer (&amp;gt;=4).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;9.&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-spacerun: yes&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;The values of pilots are set by function &apos;randn&apos;, which may cause different value at the output of models. &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;But it would have litter effect on the BER measurement. PilotsSeq is the sequence of pilots which is defined in Equations.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;,&apos;serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpLast style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;,&apos;serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;,&apos;serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpLast style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;,&apos;serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;,&apos;serif&apos;; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;Things to Try&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in 1.2pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;1.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;You can experiment with other modulation methods and verify the EVM and CCDF curves.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in 1.2pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;2.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;You can try different types of filtering with different filter lengths and verify the spectrum, especially out-of-band radiation. Check the out-of-band spectrum and OFDM, FBMC and F-OFDM.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in 1.2pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;3.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Try two subbands and see the interference from the other one and decide the number of subcarriers used as guard. Filter may have important effect on it.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpLast style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in 1.2pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;4.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Using fix PilotSeq or unfix PilotsSeq and see the influence on the spectrum. &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpLast style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;</Text>
